ernie-image --model DIR (--prompt TEXT | --prompt-file UTF8.txt) --output NEW.{png|jpg|bmp|tga}
            [--device cpu|vulkan] [--precision fp32|fp16|bf16]
            [--width N --height N] [--seed N] [--steps N] [--threads N]
            [--gpu N] [--text-device cpu]
            [--text-down-vector] (optional FP32 text reduction candidate)
            [--vae-device cpu|vulkan] [--vae-convolution direct|sgemm]
            [--pe-model DIR] [--pe-max-tokens N] [--pe-greedy]
            [--pe-temperature N] [--pe-top-p N] [--pe-seed N]
            [--metrics-json NEW.json] (allocation diagnostic build only; not a speed round)
            [--latent FILE.f32] [--embeddings FILE.f32] [--trace-dir NEWDIR]
            [--input IMAGE --strength 0..1 [--resize stretch|fit|crop] [--background #RRGGBB]]
ernie-image (--model DIR | --pe-model DIR) --verify-model
ernie-image [--model DIR] --diagnose
Text-to-image: ernie-image --model model --prompt cat --output cat.png
PE: ernie-image --model model --prompt cat --pe-model pe --pe-greedy --output cat.jpg
Img2img: ernie-image --model model --input source.jpg --prompt style --width 512 --height 384 --resize fit --output result.png
Resolution defaults to a sole model instance; shared packages require a supported width/height.
Prompt files: UTF-8, optional BOM, at most 1 MiB; whitespace is preserved.
PE is optional CPU FP32, with up to 2048 output tokens by default.
PE sampling defaults: temperature 0.6, top-p 0.95, seed 42; --pe-greedy disables sampling.
Reviewed model instances; FP32 text encoder, residuals, Euler master latent and
FP32 VAE (CPU default). CFG=1. BF16 quality is experimental.
